/-!
# Relocatable `[LibsignalPlacement]` Poll Trusted-Identity Branch

Proves `closure_trusted_placed_ok`: when `trusted = .ok true`, runs `StageP1OkTrapPlacedStmt` from
`dpPollEntryPlaced` to `dpPollEntryPlaced + 0x0868#64`, folds into `stageP2PostP1At`, and
dispatches on `opt` to `closure_pathA_placed_ok` or `closure_pathB_placed_ok`.
-/

@[expose] public section

set_option autoImplicit false
set_option maxRecDepth 200000

